OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's data security blunder
OL,4,Aover bank cards photos
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council created a major data security
OL,7,Fblunder by saving images of people's
OL,8,Fbank cards on its internal
OL,9,Fcommunications channels, a report has
OL,10,Frevealed.
OL,12,FManchester City Council's audit
OL,13,Fcommittee said the bank card photos
OL,14,Fwere saved so staff members could
OL,15,Fverify people's bank details when
OL,16,Fneeded.
OL,18,FBut the audit report said that created
OL,19,Fa "critical" and "avoidable" data
OL,20,Fsecurity risk and urged the council to
OL,21,Fstop saving such images.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
