OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's data security blunder
OL,4,Aover bank cards photos
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report section was focused on
OL,7,Fpayments to individuals for children's
OL,8,Fsocial care. The council said there was
OL,9,Fno security breach.
